Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.60,0:00:12.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,《斯巴达克斯：血与沙》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.00,0:00:16.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,《红蟒》
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.10,0:02:37.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,闭上你们的臭嘴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hold your fucking tongues.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.69,0:02:40.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让罗马人说吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let the Roman have it say.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.42,0:02:46.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,特雷斯和罗马之间有众所周知的矛盾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thrace and the republic have their known differences{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.73,0:02:49.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们并非情同手足\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We are not always being as brothers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.82,0:02:53.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是现在  我们应该不计前嫌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But let us put aside such matters{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.32,0:02:55.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,团结一致\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}uniting in just cause.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.43,0:02:58.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们侵犯了我们的领地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You pushed away into our land{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.07,0:03:01.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在居然指望我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and now you standing here asking for our help?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.17,0:03:04.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伸手求助\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your hand extended?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.08,0:03:06.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没有伸手求助\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I extend no hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.88,0:03:09.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只不过是来传达消息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm here merely to inform.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.38,0:03:12.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,米特拉达梯人和希腊人从东面进攻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mithridatic and his Greek attack from the east{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.18,0:03:14.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,侵占了黑海\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}encroaching from the Black Sea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.18,0:03:18.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,离我们村落远着呢  没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Far remote from our villages. True.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.48,0:03:22.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是日耳曼人会趁虚而入\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But the Dacians take advantage of the distraction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.48,0:03:25.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们的野蛮人大军簇居在北部\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Their barbarian hordes are massed to the north.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.68,0:03:29.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再有三四天就会到达你们村落\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}barely half a week march from your villages.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.19,0:03:32.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有多少人  数以千计\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How many?  Thousands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.39,0:03:37.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,投靠罗马吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ally yourselves with Rome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.79,0:03:40.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加入我们的浩浩大军\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Place your sevice in the auxiliary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.19,0:03:42.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,与我们共驰沙场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And join us in our campaign.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.19,0:03:45.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为了什么  为了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To what end? To what end?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.99,0:03:50.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胜利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Victory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.99,0:03:53.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如何才算胜利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And how it is to be measured?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.50,0:03:56.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,日耳曼人以前就侵占过我们的村落\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The Dacians have invaded our villages in the past.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.30,0:03:59.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,强暴妇女  虐杀孩童\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They raped our women   killed our children.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.90,0:04:02.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一波未平\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Each time we push them back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.00,0:04:03.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一波又起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Only to see them return.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.80,0:04:08.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他虽然无礼的插嘴了  但说的都是事实\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He speaks out of turn   yet the truth falls from his mouth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.10,0:04:13.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想让我们投靠罗马  要明确目的才行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If we are to ally with Rome   the purpose must be clear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.60,0:04:17.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杀死日耳曼人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The Dacians dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.60,0:04:20.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,片甲不留\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}All of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.21,0:04:25.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杀死日耳曼人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.21,0:04:27.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,片甲不留\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}All of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.81,0:04:47.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,议会决定了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The council has decided?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.41,0:04:50.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们要参战\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We go to war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.61,0:04:55.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我祈求神明  为你的剑护法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I've asked the gods to bless your sword.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.02,0:05:01.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果日耳曼人就此被铲除了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If the Dacians wiped out of our land{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.42,0:05:03.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也不再需要弄枪舞剑了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}there is no reason to pick it up again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.52,0:05:08.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不弄枪舞剑  我的丈夫又能做什么呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What my husband would do without it in his hand?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.72,0:05:13.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,锄地种田  养鸡喂鹅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Grow crops   raise goats{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.82,0:05:16.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,生儿育女\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Make children.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.03,0:05:27.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你之后不再去打仗了吗  再也不会了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You'd fight no more?  Forever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.83,0:05:29.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只为伴你左右\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To be by your side.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.14,0:05:42.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,何时行军  明日凌晨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How soon is your march?  First light.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.14,0:05:49.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那快上床吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then come to bed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.65,0:05:51.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果只剩一夜春宵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If one night is all we have left{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.65,0:05:53.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们应该享尽欢愉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I should make the most out of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.75,0:06:42.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我醒过来的时候希望身边能有你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I woke up expecting my wife beside me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.45,0:06:45.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我早起祷告\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She rose up early to pray.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.84,0:06:50.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,祈祷我的丈夫可以留在我身边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that her husband would stay with her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.95,0:06:53.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还以为我们已经说好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I thought we were in an agreement.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.05,0:06:55.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是昨晚  昨晚?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We were.  Were?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.45,0:06:59.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,昨晚  神明到来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The gods came to me last night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.95,0:07:01.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,托梦给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}in my sleep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.76,0:07:05.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么梦  我的丈夫跪在地上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What they showed you?  My husband's on his knees.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.76,0:07:08.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对一条红蛇俯首称臣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Bowing before a great red serpent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.36,0:07:12.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,生命在他的血脉中干涸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The life draining from his veins.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.86,0:07:15.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你觉得那代表什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What meaning did you take from it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.26,0:07:17.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个警示\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A warning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.06,0:07:22.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你参战了  巨大的不幸将会降临\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If you go to war   you are destined to great unfortunate things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.36,0:07:29.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,日耳曼人敬拜的是山岭狼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The Dacians worship the mountain wolves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.47,0:07:32.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们敬拜的不是蛇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They place no faith in snakes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.47,0:07:35.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过是梦一场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It was just a dream.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.87,0:07:39.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果不是呢  我向你保证  苏拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And if it isn't?  I gave you my word   Sura.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.67,0:07:42.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鲜血和荣耀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Blood and honor{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.84,0:07:44.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,铸就了男人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}it speaks to the man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.84,0:07:50.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有什么能够阻隔你我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Nothing will keep me from returning to your arms.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.94,0:07:53.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,日耳曼人不行  罗马人不行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Not the Dacians   not the Romans.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.84,0:07:56.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,神明也不行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Not the gods themselves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.05,0:08:02.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,寒夜寂寥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The nights will be so cold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.15,0:08:04.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,无君温存  情何以堪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What will I do without your arms in bed?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.95,0:08:10.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,掀起裙子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lift your dress.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.27,0:08:29.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我时刻陪伴你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Keep me close to your thighs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.87,0:08:32.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用它慰藉彼此的牵挂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The thought warm us both.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.69,0:08:52.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杀光他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Kill them all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.89,0:08:55.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就当为了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}For you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.49,0:09:57.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,保持阵型\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hold the line!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.09,0:10:04.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要干你们的老婆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'll fuck your women!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.30,0:10:06.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要干个遍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'll fuck them all!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.76,0:10:14.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,罗马军死到哪里去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Where the hell are the Romans?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.31,0:10:22.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,手下别留情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Show them no mercy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.85,0:11:10.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,罗马军  冲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Romans   fight!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.69,0:11:18.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们去哪了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Where are they going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.60,0:11:22.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来晚了吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A little late.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.60,0:11:24.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们真碍事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They are just getting in the way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.99,0:12:04.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我拉的屎都比这个好吃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My own shit would taste better.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.97,0:12:07.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,罗马人给我什么原料我就做什么  卓纳斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I cook what we give us   Dranus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.39,0:12:11.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这太不公平了  罗马人吃香的喝辣的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This is disgusting. While the Romans feasting on meat{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.82,0:12:13.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后让我们饿着肚子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We are the last to eat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.37,0:12:15.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只给残羹剩饭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The last to share the spoils.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.47,0:12:19.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是打仗的时候又让我们冲在最前线\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But always the first to be sent against those barbarian cunts.{\r}
