Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.69,0:19:58.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你离应得的荣耀也更远了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And the glory you deserves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.26,0:20:04.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你回去卡普亚吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Return to Capua.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.88,0:20:08.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么跟我父亲交代呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And my father?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.95,0:20:12.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他会怎么看待  自己宝贝女儿的男人呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How will he measure the man that so blessed with his daughter?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.97,0:20:18.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给他建个铜像\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As a colossus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.30,0:20:22.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,威慑罗马的敌人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Towering above the enemies of Rome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.33,0:20:30.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,高傲自大又娘娘腔的罗马人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Pumped arrogant Roman boy lover.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.03,0:20:32.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,简直是鬼扯  为什么这么说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}All the called liars. How would you say?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.66,0:20:34.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你听见他怎么说的吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Heard what he said?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.13,0:20:37.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,深夜里看走了眼  以为我们是小孩子啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Turned in the mountains at night   like he's speaking to children.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.40,0:20:40.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是问  你说娘娘腔  那他们站着撒尿吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No   about the boys   how do you know he pees standing up?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.38,0:20:43.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在说笑吗  我喉咙痒痒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now who's having a laugh?  There's a tickle at the back of my throat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.86,0:20:47.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你被葛雷博深喉了吧  得了吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There would be the cock Glaber just forced down. He wants to send{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.13,0:20:50.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就算他要自己人观察战势  结论也一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}his own man let him. Won't change the direction of Dacians.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.28,0:20:52.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,葛雷博是最危险的傻瓜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Glaber is the most dangerous kind of fool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.33,0:20:56.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只不过有名头罢了  那是  不过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}One with a title. Sure. But perhaps he{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.54,0:20:59.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他对酒倒是很有品\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}has better sense when it comes to wine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.36,0:21:03.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你居然偷了他的酒  借来喝两口呗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You stole his wine?  Only borrowed it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.03,0:21:04.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后过一会再"还"给他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Planned to piss it all back shortly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.97,0:21:33.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,起床了  去你妈的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Wake up!  Fuck your mother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.91,0:21:35.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,罗马人吹响号角了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The Roman sounded the horn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.56,0:21:37.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去他妈的罗马人  管他们吹不吹的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Fuck the Romans in their horses.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.86,0:21:40.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Stand up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.11,0:21:42.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,将军应该是醒悟过来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The Legatus regained his senses.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.77,0:21:45.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有酒吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Is there any wine left?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.05,0:21:49.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你肚子里不是有吗  我马上就排出来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your belly holds some.  I will return them presently.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.77,0:21:53.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走山路要走多久\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How far is the mountain path?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.35,0:21:56.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,步行三天  如果行军有意义的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Three days by foot. If we march with meaning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.30,0:21:59.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给我点酒  激发下斗志吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A drink would spur my intent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.07,0:22:03.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的村落就在西边不远处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My village is only awast from west.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.46,0:22:06.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到了以后管够你喝...  西边?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My wine is yours after...  West?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.13,0:22:09.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们是往东边走  去攻打米特拉达梯人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We march east to challenge Mithridates.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.98,0:22:13.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,将军后来派人去调查战势了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Did Legatus send his own man to discover the front?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.07,0:22:14.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我怎么知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How the fuck should I know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.86,0:22:18.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们就知道吹号  放狗乱叫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They loaded their horns and Roman dog barks{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.16,0:22:19.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,守卫兵还找我的茬\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and the guards shit on me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.89,0:22:22.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欢迎来到魔鬼军队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Welcome to the fucking assari.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.52,0:22:38.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟你谈谈  将军\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A word   Legatus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.29,0:22:40.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,列队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Move to formation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.09,0:22:42.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们要东行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We advance east.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.12,0:22:45.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是说西行吧  跟日耳曼人去一个方向\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Surely you mean west   as the Dacians advance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.26,0:22:49.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,攻打米特拉达梯人和希腊人才是当务之急\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mithridates and the Greeks are our pressing concern.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.35,0:22:52.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们既然投靠了罗马\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You have allied yourselves with Rome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.91,0:22:55.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就是罗马的权代人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm its body and voice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.44,0:22:59.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们东行  去黑海\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We march east   to the Black Sea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.03,0:23:01.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,列队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Fort formation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.41,0:23:07.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,列队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Fort formation!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.62,0:23:12.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.30,0:23:17.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你居然公然反抗你的将军\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You will defy order from your Legatus?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.76,0:23:20.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我承诺过要全力攻退日耳曼人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I gave my word to defend against the Dacians.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.55,0:23:24.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没说过要东行  攻打米特拉达梯人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Not to march east   to attack Mithridates.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.73,0:23:27.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我命令你去哪  你就要往哪行军\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You will march where you are commanded!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.41,0:23:37.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杀光他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Kill them!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.39,0:23:41.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Wait! Wait!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.04,0:24:04.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,侍卫官跑了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The Tribune!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.44,0:24:23.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你他妈的  看看你干的好事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What you've done you stupid shit?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.65,0:24:25.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他必须这样做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He did what he had to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.94,0:24:27.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家散伙各奔东西吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Break and go your way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.83,0:24:30.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的村落在西边  就往那走  要不是的话...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To the west if your life is there... If not{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.73,0:24:32.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也管不着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I don't give a fuck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.96,0:24:36.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,将军怎么处理\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What about Legatus?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.67,0:24:40.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让他自生自灭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Leave him in the mud.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.67,0:27:07.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们的村落\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The village.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.22,0:27:19.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们必须离开这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We have to go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.63,0:27:21.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,马上走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.83,0:27:45.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们没有追过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They haven't followed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.72,0:28:04.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说的对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You were right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.44,0:28:07.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就不该去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I never should have left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.33,0:28:12.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你跟他保证过的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You had given him your word.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.13,0:28:15.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不像他们  随意食言\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You're not like the Romans breaking theirs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.02,0:28:22.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你受伤了  没什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You're hurt.  Nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.08,0:28:23.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我看看  苏拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let me see.  Sura.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.54,0:28:24.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我看看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let me see!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.95,0:28:31.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你总吼我  你该习惯了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You tell me just quietly. you should be used by now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.68,0:28:41.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm alright.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.89,0:28:46.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还说没事  别动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Of course you are. Stand still.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.01,0:29:02.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都没了  是吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's gone   isn't it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.86,0:29:05.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们的村落\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The village...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.13,0:29:08.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们的朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Everyone we knew.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.24,0:29:12.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们往南走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We move south.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.91,0:29:16.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那边有我认识的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I had people there once.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.19,0:29:20.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,日耳曼人不会跟那么远\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The Dacians won't venture that far.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.69,0:29:22.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们想要保证兵力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They will not take risks in their numbers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.26,0:29:29.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那罗马人呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And the Romans?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.38,0:29:34.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们关心的是东边的米特拉达梯人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They are concerned about mithridates to the east.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.59,0:29:41.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就往南去吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}South it is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.93,0:29:48.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真希望我自己能以一当百\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I wish I have been a thousand men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.47,0:30:05.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你尽力了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You did what you could.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.05,0:30:09.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为了我  你回来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You came back for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.64,0:30:15.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,即便知道会赔上你自己的性命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Knowing you could mean your life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.03,0:30:25.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有你  我活着又有什么意义\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There is no life without you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.93,0:32:42.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的侍卫官死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My tribune is dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.65,0:32:45.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的将士全当了逃兵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}After your auxiliary deserted{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.33,0:32:48.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要募集更多的人手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Orders are recalling me to round more of your hands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.60,0:32:50.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一人做事一人当\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I own my actions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.78,0:32:53.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我妻子她  沦为奴隶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But my wife...  has been condemned to slavery.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.92,0:32:56.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜其丈夫所赐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Courtesy of her husband.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.17,0:33:00.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  不  不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No. No. No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.07,0:33:04.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在罗马的天罗地网下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Shadow of Rome is fast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.40,0:33:08.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这个特雷斯人  只不过是瓮中之鳖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And you   Thracian   will die under it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.95,0:33:35.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欢迎加入我们的行列\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Good for you to join us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.96,0:33:38.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我差点以为你就这么死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I thought you were dead there for a while.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.66,0:33:42.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已经散发着尸体的臭气了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You smell like dead. Idiot fuck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.15,0:33:46.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,淡定  淡定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Easy. Easy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.79,0:33:48.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你都昏迷好几天了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You've been out for days.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.24,0:33:54.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们在海上吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We are at sea?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.16,0:33:57.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亚得里亚海\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Upon Adriatic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.12,0:34:00.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,往卡普亚方向\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Direct to Capua.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.43,0:34:04.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的苏拉  你的女人?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sura. Your woman?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.24,0:34:07.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,罗马人带走了她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The Romans took her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.91,0:34:11.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还是忘了她吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Best forget it then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.24,0:34:51.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不怕我是刺客\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And if I being an assassin?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.27,0:34:56.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,父亲到镇上了  很快就会回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Father is in town   he will be back shortly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.45,0:34:58.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有多快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How shortly?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.26,0:35:00.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,父亲对你颇有微词\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He is not very happy with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.72,0:35:06.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那他的女儿呢  很想念你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And his daughter?  She misses her husband.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.61,0:35:11.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过你这么早回来  也让我忐忑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But fears his reappearance has come too soon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.10,0:35:18.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你父亲举办的竞技\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The games that your father present to the people of Capua...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.23,0:35:19.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明天开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They begin tomorrow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.92,0:35:24.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今晚是大宴宾客  这是他回来的目的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The feast is tonight?  That is his purpose in town.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.15,0:35:25.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会和他谈谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'll have a word with him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.98,0:35:30.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要重获父亲的赏识绝非易事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It will take more than one to regain his favor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.91,0:35:34.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,元老院里很多流言  质疑你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The Senate chamber is full of whispers of your...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.46,0:35:38.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,提前归来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Early return.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.60,0:35:43.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,民众的欢呼声自然能堵上他们的嘴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The cheers of the crowd will steal their tongues.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.85,0:35:48.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欢呼声  没有胜利哪来的欢呼声\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Cheers? How will you draw them short of a victory?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.33,0:35:51.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让他们大开眼界就行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}By giving something fewer of them have ever seen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.50,0:35:56.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,特雷斯人血溅竞技场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thracian blood spilled the arena.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.89,0:36:00.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,必定赢得观众的欢心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Winning the hearts of the crowd.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.66,0:36:03.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,元老院定会拥护你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And the Senate will beg to follow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.97,0:36:05.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,滚开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Get out of my sight!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.76,0:36:09.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,忘恩负义的混蛋们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ingrate shitholes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.56,0:36:12.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我该把你们都卖到矿区去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I should sell to all of you to the mines.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.23,0:36:14.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,父亲回来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Father returned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.13,0:36:16.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,心情不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And in a fine state.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.23,0:36:18.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你不愿替我美言\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If you refuse to add my attention...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.21,0:36:23.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要我装点可怜  父亲会答应我任何事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He will refuse his daughter nothing when pleaded with a teary eye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.79,0:36:51.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亲爱的卡普亚子民们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dear citizens of Capua.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.08,0:36:53.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各位来宾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Guests of honor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.12,0:36:55.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,非常感谢大家前来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have great gratitude for participating{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.22,0:36:58.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,参加阿比努斯家族的庆典\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the celebration of family named Albinius.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.04,0:37:01.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿比努斯  阿比努斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Albinius! Albinius!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.44,0:37:06.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各位的光临表达了对先祖的敬意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your attendance honors the memory of my elders{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.79,0:37:09.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先祖仙逝多年\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}who gone too soon for the realm of the living.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.84,0:37:14.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,幸好膝下仍有一女  带来生命的乐趣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And to the joy of a daughter yet so full of life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.37,0:37:18.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我仅以生命之水作为回报\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I repay your kindness with a gift of water.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.73,0:37:24.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,由罗马带来  携神明之护佑  保天下之富足\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Carried from Rome   where the gods saved to keep drought to the bay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.03,0:37:28.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,同时我们的竞技场将再掀血雨腥风\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And gifts of blood to respill in the arena.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.78,0:37:36.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,首先有请昆图斯•巴蒂塔斯•兰图拉斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Quintus Batiatus Lentulus   step forward.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.77,0:37:49.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请介绍你的角斗士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Present your gladiators.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.77,0:37:56.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尊敬的阿比努斯元老及卡普亚人民\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In honor of Senator Albinius and people of Capua...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.20,0:38:01.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巴尔卡  我们来自迦太基的猛兽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I give Barca   The Beast of Carthage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.08,0:38:08.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是  面对克雷斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}However   its savagery pales against the titans of the arena{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.27,0:38:12.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们的竞技之王  角斗之神\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the god of blood and sand   Crixus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.43,0:38:15.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还是略逊一筹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The undefeated gold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.40,0:38:22.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感谢巴蒂塔斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Gratitude to Batiatus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.47,0:38:32.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接下来有请\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And now...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.93,0:38:38.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,马尔库斯•德西乌斯•索罗尼斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Marcus Decius Solonius and its offerings.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.70,0:38:48.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尊敬的阿比努斯元老及卡普亚人民\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In honor of Senator Albinius and people of Capua...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.55,0:38:51.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我带来了六个顶级高手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I bring you 6 of my finest men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.73,0:38:53.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有请  阿凯迪亚斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Behold   Arkadios{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.88,0:38:55.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,令雅典人闻风丧胆之辈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the scourge of Athens.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.99,0:39:00.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,狗娘养的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Bastard piece of shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.62,0:39:03.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,造势的行家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A Mockery profession.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.44,0:39:06.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么造势了  我说的不对么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What mockery is it?  You disagree?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.03,0:39:07.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,随他去吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let him pass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.48,0:39:09.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们是客人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We're guests of the senator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.93,0:39:13.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,元老都邀请我们坐主看台了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He has invited us to sit in the platform tomorrow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.40,0:39:15.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这还有点像话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Little consolation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.50,0:39:17.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只派了两个人上场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Only two of my men will retain to fight tomorrow{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.96,0:39:21.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可这家伙派了足足六个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}while Solonius secures half a dozen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.83,0:39:27.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是个阿谀奉承拍马屁的老手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This man has fingers in all the proper assholes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.13,0:39:29.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还会兴风作浪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He moves and all shit going.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.30,0:39:34.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感谢索罗尼斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Gratitude to Solonius.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.19,0:39:40.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是雨水甘露竞技是属于大家的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But the water and the games didn't just praise{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.36,0:39:43.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿尔比努尔斯不敢一人独享\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}for the city without a name Albinius has its own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.57,0:39:45.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有更多人值得这样的荣耀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}More deserves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.04,0:39:50.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,神明也赐予我的女儿一个合格丈夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The gods consider it suitable husband for my daughter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.14,0:39:54.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,克罗迪斯•葛雷博将军\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Legadus Claudius Glaber.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.33,0:39:57.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,新近从荒蛮之地特雷斯归来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Newly return from the savage lands of Thrace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.32,0:40:16.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为卡普亚人民\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}More gifts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.38,0:40:18.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呈上我的心意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}For the people of Capua.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.90,0:40:22.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,六个特雷斯的叛乱之徒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}6 Thracians scoundrels.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.38,0:40:26.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对日耳曼战争中的无耻逃兵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Deserters from the war against the Dacians barbarians.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.08,0:40:32.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明日竞技场上将得到他们应有的审判\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To be executed at the gladium in tomorrow's games.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.90,0:40:47.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他的呼声挺高的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He is well received.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.68,0:40:52.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再有下次  你的眼泪就不值钱了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ask a favor for him again and your tears will not be short of notice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.71,0:40:57.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美酒仙乐  大家尽情享乐吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Right   now more music and drink.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.41,0:41:12.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,特雷斯人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thracians...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.17,0:41:15.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和这群野兽之流搅和\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}between those animals and Solonius offerings{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.19,0:41:18.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,根本就是笑柄  葛雷博提到审判\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That's mockery all it can take.  Glaber mentioned execution{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.17,0:41:20.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正好我们的人能派上用场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that's what could let our men to do the task.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.17,0:41:22.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们晚了一步\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The position has been occupied.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.23,0:41:23.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正好  索罗尼斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Good   Solonius.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.37,0:41:26.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们正说您今晚好一身华服\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I was just marveling at your wears.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.37,0:41:28.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And I yours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.30,0:41:31.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,过奖  这是事实\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You flatter.  No   I appreciate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.67,0:41:34.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真高兴再见到你  我的老朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Good to lay the eyes   old friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.70,0:41:37.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还担心或许没邀请你呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I feared for a time you would be excluded.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.40,0:41:40.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,若无巴蒂塔斯  再精彩的角斗也黯然失色\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Games without Batiatus are like a dorm without a sun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.15,0:41:44.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,克雷斯和巴尔卡  不错的选手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Crixus and Barca   2 fine entries.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.49,0:41:47.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,应该能给我们提供点娱乐消遣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They should provide distraction between the more important battles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.04,0:41:54.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,元老叫我了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Senator backens{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.05,0:41:56.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,万一明天没见到你...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If I miss you at the games tomorrow...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.20,0:41:59.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不太可能  我们受邀上主看台了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Unlikely   we have been invited to stay in the cabin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.01,0:42:02.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和元老一起观战  莫大的荣耀啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Cabin with the senator   a great honor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.52,0:42:06.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到时候主看台见了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'll enjoy your company there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.80,0:42:14.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总有一天我要挖出他的心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I should witness his heart on a day apart from his chest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.36,0:42:16.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我必定是持刀的那个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And I should grab the knife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.75,0:43:03.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还从没见过这种景观\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I had never beheld such sights.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.95,0:43:06.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以后再也看不见了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And will not consider again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.86,0:45:36.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家很喜欢这个环节\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The crowd approves his gifts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.82,0:45:38.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,彼此彼此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That's do we all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.22,0:45:42.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,精彩的还在后头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would hold something of note for the last.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.09,0:46:13.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,准备受死吧  特雷斯杂种\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ready   Thracian cunt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.66,0:46:47.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看样引起公愤了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You seem out of favor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.44,0:46:50.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个特雷斯人给罗马造成了极大的危害\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This Thracian caused Rome a great disservice  father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.12,0:46:53.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他的怯懦胆小导致了将士们的集体叛逃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He's cowardice led to mass desertion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.91,0:46:56.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那为什么不直接杀了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}His life no longer pays?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.25,0:46:59.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们必须杀鸡儆猴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He must be humiliated   as an example.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.94,0:47:03.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,索罗尼斯慷慨的提供了手下的角斗士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Solonius was kind enough to offer his services in this act.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.65,0:47:13.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下令吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Give the command.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.30,0:48:32.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,落人笑柄  淡定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A mockery.  Be still.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.19,0:48:48.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杀光他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Kill them all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.69,0:50:04.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,干掉他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Kill!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.85,0:50:34.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,活命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Live!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.97,0:50:54.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这有点棘手了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This present some difficulties here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.66,0:50:56.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,死刑的判决不能更改\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The sentence of death holds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.58,0:51:01.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,违背民意不是明智之举  就算我是元老\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But to defy the wished of the crowd is not wise   even for a senator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.61,0:51:05.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他罪大恶极  罪不可赦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He gave me grief   I would not see him free.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.02,0:51:09.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,将军  我有个办法  不知是否可行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A solution   perhaps   if you're entertained   Legadus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.11,0:51:11.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这特雷斯人在竞技场上表现出过人技艺\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The Thracian shows promise in the arena{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.83,0:51:15.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,索罗尼斯的角斗士也不是对手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}even if it was men against lower Solonius.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.09,0:51:17.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有一批新人手明天会到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have a batch of new recruits arriving tomorrow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.55,0:51:20.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以把这位也归入队伍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If I can departure this man in addition{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.36,0:51:23.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,新人们会在角斗馆内集训\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To be trained in my ludis or gladiatorial lots{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.13,0:51:26.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他目前这状况  估计没多少日子了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}By this condition i doubt he could survive to the quarter moon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.75,0:51:36.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还是从宽处理为好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We will be merciful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.63,0:51:39.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们不也希望赢得百姓的拥戴吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And by such gain the favor you seek.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.22,0:51:44.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他叫什么名字\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What name is this man?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.84,0:51:47.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,无心过问\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I never cared to ask.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.50,0:51:50.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他角斗的方式\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The way he fights{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.96,0:51:53.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正如关于古特雷斯王的传说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}as the legend of the Thracian king of old.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.87,0:52:00.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他叫斯巴达克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Spartacus he was called.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.02,0:52:13.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡普亚的子民们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}People of Capua{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.01,0:52:17.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这位勇士  斯巴达克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}this man   this Spartacus{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.67,0:52:20.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在竞技场上证明了自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}has proven himself in the arena.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.93,0:52:26.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为此我和葛雷博将军共同决定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}For this   Legadus Claudius Glaber and I grant him...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.35,0:52:29.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,饶他一死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}life.{\r}
